  },
  {
    q: 'How much does a Maha Bhetra day charter cost?',
    a: 'A full-day private charter for up to 12 guests is THB 202,000 (about USD 6,100) all year, and THB 231,000 (about USD 7,000) in peak season, 20 December to 10 January. Rates are per charter, not per person, and include local VAT.'
  },
  {
    q: 'Which islands can we visit?',
    a: 'Day charters cruise to Phang Nga Bay, Koh Hong in Krabi, Kai and Naka Islands, or Koh Maiton and Koh Kai. Overnight charters can reach Koh Phi Phi, the Racha Islands and, on trips of four days or more, the Similan Islands. Longer charters to the Mergui Archipelago in Myanmar need advance permits.'
  },
  {
